{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ninja MMORPG with hardcore, old-school MMORPG inspirations and Open World PvP.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you miss the good old days of MMORPGs? Nin Online is Inspired by classic MMORPGs and anime from the 2000s.\u00a0Free-to-play with zero Pay-to-win mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/561ab521c82792926368b4d9b49ad3fe.poster.avif?t=1770860073\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/561ab521c82792926368b4d9b49ad3fe.webm?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/561ab521c82792926368b4d9b49ad3fe.mp4?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from 3 Villages or become a Rogue Ninja</strong><br>Start off as in one of three factions, grow up in the safety of the gates of each village. But once you're strong enough, you can choose to abandon your home and become a hermit... or even a rogue ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/99c1b6aa5296796753fa06cdde7b3ab1.poster.avif?t=1770860073\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/99c1b6aa5296796753fa06cdde7b3ab1.webm?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/99c1b6aa5296796753fa06cdde7b3ab1.mp4?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World PvP for the Modern Era</strong><br>Nin Online's game design encourages Open World Player vs. Player combat, while allowing players to take a break from the chaos and focus on training in some areas. Safe Zones allow you to train while War Zones enforce Open World PvP. Challenge seekers and chill players both have a home in our Ninja World.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/3a1ef9a211646fc82e5c6c1616ad29dd.poster.avif?t=1770860073\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/3a1ef9a211646fc82e5c6c1616ad29dd.webm?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/3a1ef9a211646fc82e5c6c1616ad29dd.mp4?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Customization</strong><br>Choose to be part of a clan, join an organization or sign a contract with an animal familiar. Combined with thousands of equipable items, no two ninja will ever look or be the same. Nin Online is a game where you are encouraged to express yourself. Looking good doesn't cost you to lose fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/a512b0ffdbd4cc15259b7933caa25ace.poster.avif?t=1770860073\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/a512b0ffdbd4cc15259b7933caa25ace.webm?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/a512b0ffdbd4cc15259b7933caa25ace.mp4?t=1770860073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly and active community &amp; developers</strong><br>The greatest feature of Nin Online is it's tight knit community and social features. The developers are active in our chat channels and have been constantly listening to feedback improving it since it's release. The game is still in active development with updates being made on a weekly and sometimes daily basis. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Begin Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/786fccee967ff8d429d39030efdc7aacd141e140.jpg"},{"name":"Enemy Territory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/b6ea788d5221c2f83a6da9c868dd30e572b0e454.jpg"},{"name":"Summoning Technique","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/684ffe94ccd4611877b9911f1d8fcc9778fa57d2.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Basics I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/63e530867364ed90d2dcbf53cdf11209db7c5fcf.jpg"},{"name":"D-Rank Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/d19ad10d3fe4c1da576b4134c13a5de9ef0e56cf.jpg"},{"name":"C-Rank Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/cc41e478088ea6412a826133b2efc4eda9ee1d67.jpg"},{"name":"B-Rank Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/756e569c7c7297be99fdcc399c845dd9518e4327.jpg"},{"name":"A-Rank Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/911a0b8541b114016b143e78a72ae9ba0d5bc7a1.jpg"},{"name":"S-Rank Missions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1674010/7ea0ddef9494991452af3c03d770a1a5094f5382.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1674010?t=1770860073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/bcc8e8356b8598e53b42922161d54e28b987c597/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770860073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/2c2fadfa6bd47a68ce65d09d3e11d345bf03d151/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770860073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/2c2fadfa6bd47a68ce65d09d3e11d345bf03d151/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770860073","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ninja MMORPG with hardcore, old-school MMORPG inspirations and Open World PvP.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you miss the good old days of MMORPGs? Nin Online is Inspired by classic MMORPGs and anime from the 2000s.\u00a0Free-to-play with zero Pay-to-win mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674010/extras/561ab521c82792926368b4d9b49ad3fe.poster.avif?t=1770860073\" width=780 height=200 ><source sr